Package: PLIER2Data
Type: Package
Title: Experiment Data for the PLIER2 Package
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Marc", "Subirana-Granes", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "mb2subi@gmail.com",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3934-839X"))
Description: Contains RNA-Seq and metadata files used as examples in the
    vignettes of the PLIER2 Bioconductor package. The data includes a
    whole-blood expression matrix, an HDF5 file with Alzheimer's brain
    samples, and count data from a study on pancreatic islets. These
    datasets support the primary software package's documentation.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/pivlab/PLIER2Data
BugReports: https://github.com/pivlab/PLIER2Data/issues
VignetteBuilder: knitr
